msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:41
msgid ""
"This effect/filter adjusts the color white balance selectively for blacks "
"and whites. This filter operates in :term:`YUV` color space."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter selektívne upravuje vyváženie bielej farby pre čierne a "
"biele plochy. Tento filter pracuje v farebnom priestore :term:`YUV`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:45
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:52
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:53
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:55
msgid "Analyze mode"
msgstr "Analyzovať"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:56
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Výber"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:57
msgid ""
"If set to anything other than **manual** it will analyze every frame and use "
"derived parameters for filtering the output frame."
msgstr ""
"Ak je nastavené na čokoľvek iné ako **ručne**, bude analyzovať každú snímku "
"a používať odvodené parametre na filtrovanie výstupnej snímky."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:58
msgid "Red shadow spot"
msgstr "Červený tieňový bod"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:59
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:62
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:65
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:68
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:71
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:60
msgid ""
"Set the red shadow spot. Default is 0.0. Allowed range is from -1.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví červený tieňový bod. Predvolená hodnota je 0,0. Povolený rozsah je "
"od -1,0 do 1,0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:61
msgid "Blue shadow spot"
msgstr "Modrý tieňový bod"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:63
msgid ""
"Set the blue shadow spot. Default is 0.0. Allowed range is from -1.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví modrý tieňový bod. Predvolená hodnota je 0,0. Povolený rozsah je od "
"-1,0 do 1,0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:64
msgid "Red highlight spot"
msgstr "Zvýrazniť vrcholy"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:66
msgid ""
"Set the red highlight spot. Default is 0.0. Allowed range is from -1.0 to "
"1.0."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví červený bod svetiel. Predvolená hodnota je 0,0. Povolený rozsah je "
"od -1,0 do 1,0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:67
msgid "Blue highlight spot"
msgstr "Modrý bod svetiel"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:69
msgid ""
"Set the blue highlight spot. Default is 0.0. Allowed range is from -1.0 to "
"1.0."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví modrý bod svetiel. Predvolená hodnota je 0,0. Povolený rozsah je od "
"-1,0 do 1,0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:70
msgid "Saturation"
msgstr "Nasýtenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_correct.rst:72
msgid ""
"Set the amount of :term:`saturation`. Default value is 1.0. Allowed range is "
"from -3.0 to 3.0."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví množstvo :term:`nasýtenia`. Predvolená hodnota je 1,0. Povolený "
"rozsah je od -3,0 do 3,0."

